From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp60: Implement the argument-less facet _Getcat functions.

Fast mode for msvcp60: VC6's argument-less static _Getcat of the facets
(locale::facet, collate, ctype, codecvt, numpunct, num_get, num_put,
time_get, time_put) were spec stubs; they return the facet's category
(-1 for the facet base class).
---
 dlls/msvcp60/msvcp60.spec | 68 +++++++++++++++++++++++------------------------
 dlls/msvcp90/locale.c     | 16 +++++++++++
 2 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

